    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i've been taking sertraline (50mg) for a few months for my anxiety and it's working pretty good but i've got this really annoying cough from a cold. i'm looking at taking some of that generic cough syrup with dextromethorphan in it just to sleep better tonight... is it okay to take those together or is there any issue with mixing them?",
