      "content": "i know, i read about serotonin syndrome online and it sounds scary but i feel fine right now. i'm just really tired of coughing and i'm not really able to get a doctor on the phone until monday. is it really that dangerous for just one dose? i mean it's just a standard dose of the syrup, surely that won't cause a massive reaction?",
